{"id":"18ba781019fc626c","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-cycle-cover.md","title":"Directed Cycle Covers and Weights","display":"df-cycle-cover — Directed Cycle Covers and Weights","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-cycle-cover","aliases":["28-df-cycle-cover"],"display":"df-cycle-cover — Directed Cycle Covers and Weights","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §17.3.1 before Theorem 17.11","source_printed_pages":"347–348","source_pdf_pages":"373–374","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-cycle-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-cycle-cover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cycle-cover — Directed Cycle Covers and Weights"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §17.3.1 before Theorem 17.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"347–348"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"373–374"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=[n]\">\\(V=[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq V\\times V\">\\(E\\subseteq V\\times V\\)</span> 为有向边集，允许自环；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为交换含幺环，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:E\\to R\">\\(w:E\\to R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CC}(G)\">\\(\\mathcal{CC}(G)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_w(F)\">\\(W_w(F)\\)</span> 为以下构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\">\\(G=(V,E)\\)</span>，空乘积为1。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CC}(G)\\coloneqq\\{F\\subseteq E:\\forall v\\in V\\ |\\{u:(u,v)\\in F\\}|=|\\{u:(v,u)\\in F\\}|=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CC}(G)\\coloneqq\\{F\\subseteq E:\\forall v\\in V\\ |\\{u:(u,v)\\in F\\}|=|\\{u:(v,u)\\in F\\}|=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_w(F)\\coloneqq\\prod_{e\\in F}w(e)\\qquad(F\\in\\mathcal{CC}(G)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_w(F)\\coloneqq\\prod_{e\\in F}w(e)\\qquad(F\\in\\mathcal{CC}(G)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>入度和出度各1的有限有向生成子图唯一分解为顶点不交有向圈，包括自环。允许自环与有向权重是permanent图解释所需条件，不能替换成无向无环图。n=0有唯一空覆盖。</p>\n<p>来源：§17.3.1 before Theorem 17.11；印刷页 347–348；PDF 页 373–374。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第17章的 Directed Cycle Covers and Weights，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"V=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq V\\times V","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"w:E\\to R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{CC}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"W_w(F)","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{CC}(G)\\coloneqq\\{F\\subseteq E:\\forall v\\in V\\ |\\{u:(u,v)\\in F\\}|=|\\{u:(v,u)\\in F\\}|=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"W_w(F)\\coloneqq\\prod_{e\\in F}w(e)\\qquad(F\\in\\mathcal{CC}(G)).","display":true}],"bytes":1602,"backlinks":[{"id":"8c3be7e8c8cc164e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$E\\subseteq[n]\\times[n]$，$G=([n],E)$，$w:E\\to R$，$R$ 为交换含幺环；$\\mathcal{CC},W_w$ 见 [[28-df-cycle-cover]]，$\\operatorname{perm}$ 见 [[28-df-permanent]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-363","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-permanent]]、[[28-df-cycle-cover]]、[[28-lem-permanent-cycle-cover]]、[[28-df-parity-p]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}